// Generic schema declarations for syntax helpers used by the TRUST dataset
// parser. These keywords have no associated C++ class — they describe
// parser-only grammar fragments (comment markers, opaque block readers,
// fixed-size word / number tuples) referenced by name from other attr
// declarations throughout the codebase. Moved here from
// Outils/trustify/doc/TRAD_2.org during the trustify reshaping. See
// Outils/trustify/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-19-trustify-reshaping-gap-analysis-design.md.

// XD comment objet_u # NO_BRACE Comments in a data file.
// XD attr comm chaine comm REQ Text to be commented.

// XD bloc_comment objet_u /* NO_BRACE bloc of Comment in a data file.
// XD attr comm chaine comm REQ Text to be commented.

// XD listobj listobj_impl listobj INHERITS_BRACE List of objects.

// XD objet_lecture objet_u objet_lecture INHERITS_BRACE Auxiliary class for reading.

// XD bloc_lecture objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE to read between two braces
// XD attr bloc_lecture chaine bloc_lecture REQ not_set

// XD deuxmots objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Two words.
// XD attr mot_1 chaine mot_1 REQ First word.
// XD attr mot_2 chaine mot_2 REQ Second word.

// XD troismots objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Three words.
// XD attr mot_1 chaine mot_1 REQ First word.
// XD attr mot_2 chaine mot_2 REQ Snd word.
// XD attr mot_3 chaine mot_3 REQ Third word.

// XD quatremots objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Three words.
// XD attr mot_1 chaine mot_1 REQ First word.
// XD attr mot_2 chaine mot_2 REQ Snd word.
// XD attr mot_3 chaine mot_3 REQ Third word.
// XD attr mot_4 chaine mot_4 REQ Fourth word.

// XD deuxentiers objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Two integers.
// XD attr int1 entier int1 REQ First integer.
// XD attr int2 entier int2 REQ Second integer.

// XD floatfloat objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Two reals.
// XD attr a floattant a REQ First real.
// XD attr b floattant b REQ Second real.

// XD entierfloat objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE An integer and a real.
// XD attr the_int entier the_int REQ Integer.
// XD attr the_float floattant the_float REQ Real.

// XD class_generic objet_u class_generic INHERITS_BRACE not_set

// XD troisf objet_lecture nul NO_BRACE Auxiliary class to extrude.
// XD attr lx floattant lx REQ X direction of the extrude operation.
// XD attr ly floattant ly REQ Y direction of the extrude operation.
// XD attr lz floattant lz REQ Z direction of the extrude operation.
